---
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "@components/container.astro";
import Sectionhead from "@components/sectionhead.astro";

// Filter team entries with 'draft: false' & date before current date
const publishedTeamMembers = await getCollection("team", ({ data }) => {
  return !data.draft && data.publishDate < new Date();
});
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
  <Container>
    <Sectionhead>
      <Fragment slot="title">Privacy Policy</Fragment>
      <Fragment slot="desc">
        Effective Date: 01/28/2025 Owner: AllSmart Inc.</Fragment
      >
    </Sectionhead>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 mx-auto max-w-4xl mt-16">
      <h2 class="font-bold text-3xl text-gray-800">Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
        AllSmart Inc. ("we," "us," or "our") values your privacy and is
        committed to protecting your personal information. By using the
        Rebalance APP ("App"), you agree to the collection and use of
        information as described in this Privacy Policy.
      </p>
      <h3 class="font-bold text-3xl text-gray-800">
        1. No Financial Advice & No Liability
      </h3>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
        The App is provided for informational and portfolio management purposes
        only. It does not provide financial, investment, or trading advice. You
        are solely responsible for your investment decisions, and AllSmart Inc.
        is not liable for any losses incurred due to market volatility,
        incorrect configurations, or actions taken based on information within
        the App. AllSmart Inc. is not responsible for any errors, delays, or
        failures in executing trades, as all transactions are performed through
        third-party brokerages. Users should verify all trade details before
        execution. Additionally, users should always verify the recommended
        rebalance operations and total order values with their corresponding
        brokerage system. Market volatility and prices will ultimately be
        executed and finalized by the brokerage and its processing mechanisms.
      </p>
      <h3 class="font-bold text-3xl text-gray-800">
        2. Data Collection & Storage
      </h3>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
        The App does not collect, store, or share any personally identifiable
        information (PII). The App only interacts with brokerage accounts using
        secure authentication methods.
      </p>
      <h3 class="font-bold text-3xl text-gray-800">3. Security & Encryption</h3>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
          1. The App stores brokerage access keys (API key and secret) retrieved
          from the brokerage system (E*TRADE) to facilitate secure API requests.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
          2. These credentials are stored using Android's AES/GCM/NoPadding
          encryption mechanism, ensuring data remains encrypted on the device.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
          3. The App does not transmit or share brokerage credentials with any
          external parties.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
          4. While we implement industry-standard encryption mechanisms,
          AllSmart Inc. cannot guarantee absolute security, and users
          acknowledge that they use the App at their own risk.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
          5. Users are responsible for securing their devices and ensuring that
          unauthorized parties do not gain access to their brokerage
          credentials.
        </p>
      </p>
      <h3 class="font-bold text-3xl text-gray-800">
        4. Third-Party Brokerages
      </h3>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
        The App currently integrates with E*TRADE and may support additional
        brokerages in the future. Users are subject to the respective
        brokerage's terms and conditions when executing trades through the App.
        AllSmart Inc. has no control over brokerage services, transaction
        processing, or account management.
      </p>
      <h3 class="font-bold text-3xl text-gray-800">
        5. Data Sharing & Third Parties
      </h3>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
        We do not sell, rent, or share any user data with third parties. Any
        data processed within the App remains on the user’s device and is used
        solely for interacting with the brokerage API.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Layout>
